$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2fdropw  LOC_AFTER=?

* The scan loop of the fragment ` dropNum ` of TM/Prims.lean: the label consumes the whole scanned word, one step per letter.  An instantiation of ~ tm2hwrd , which does once and for all the induction Lean's ` dropNum_loop ` does by hand.

